      "updated": 1786770121781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to solve this ? \n1. This is definetely BFS algorithm due to level order traversal\n2. We can use a boolean flag , like if inverted\n    if flag is true , push from right \n    else push from left like normal \n",
